data for different horizons\n2. For horizon 1, it should be excluded (missing data path)\n3. For horizon 3, it should be included with specific gate_metadata\n4. After run_fold(), verify that FoldMetrics.gate_metadata matches horizon 3's gate_metadata, not horizon 1's\n\nLet me write this test now.\n</thinking>\n\nI'll add a comprehensive test case that verifies metadata selection from the first included horizon in partial success scenarios.","time":{"start":1781049262515,"end":1781049286293}}}
